   "start": 316.016,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "第九个，Google Design。它不是组件库，而是 Google 的设计编辑平台。",
     "start": 316.566,
     "end": 321.603,
     "subs": [
      {
       "text": "第九个，Google Design",
       "start": 316.566,
       "end": 318.307
      },
      {
       "text": "它不是组件库",
       "start": 318.307,
       "end": 319.478
      },
      {
       "text": "而是 Google 的设计编辑平台",
       "start": 319.478,
       "end": 321.603
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "核心理念是 Design is never done，设计永无止境。",
     "start": 321.963,
     "end": 325.422,
     "subs": [
      {
       "text": "核心理念是 Design is never done",
